## Frontend ship checklists

Same spirit as **creating a ticket** (`tickets/new`): labels, RTL, responsive, role gates, tests, API sync.

### New test suite

- [ ] Arabic labels in `constants.ts` (`TESTING_LABELS`, `TEST_STATE_LABELS`)
- [ ] Hook synced with `POST /test-suites` (`barmijly-api-sync`)
- [ ] Company/system scoped pickers; owner defaults to actor
- [ ] List card: health spine + pass-rate bar after first case run
- [ ] Skeleton + empty state on list page
- [ ] `*.test.tsx` for list page + `SuiteListCard`
- [ ] Works at 360px and `lg`

### New test case (in workspace)

- [ ] `OrderedStepList` for خطوات التنفيذ — not a textarea
- [ ] ≥1 step required to publish
- [ ] Case-level attachments separate from step screenshots
- [ ] Footer: result segmented control + save actions; sticky on mobile
- [ ] `TestCasePanel` filter pills including «المُسندة إليّ»
- [ ] Specs for `OrderedStepList`, `StepRow`, `TestCaseDetail`
- [ ] Mobile: panel → full-screen detail with back

### File a bug (`BugEditorDialog`)

- [ ] Shared dialog: case context strip **or** company/system pickers
- [ ] `OrderedStepList` for خطوات إعادة الإنتاج
- [ ] Three actions: «حفظ كمسودة» · «حفظ» · «حفظ وإنشاء تذكرة»
- [ ] Modal shell per `frontend-nextjs.mdc` (backdrop, `brm-modal`, scroll body)
- [ ] Spec covers both entry points (from case vs bugs page)

### Bugs list + ticket section

- [ ] Stat tiles (`.brm-stat`); «بدون تذكرة» filter + inline «إنشاء تذكرة»
- [ ] `TicketTestingSection` on ticket page — no tabs; between tasks and comments
- [ ] Read-only steps in ticket section
- [ ] Page/component tests + responsive pass

