## Tests (required)

- Backend: `*.spec.ts` next to each service — see `TEST_SUITES_PLAN.md` §3.8 and §4.8
- Frontend: `*.test.tsx` next to each component under `components/testing/` and each app route
- Run `npm run check` before push

Manual QA: `barmijly-qa-testing` skill + accounts in `QA_TESTING.md`.
